-the-top. Lyrics must be in pure English, no Chinese language."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "title": "description_prompt：描述提示词（决定歌曲风格、歌词内容、氛围）", "mode": 2, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [466.9615173339844, 213.79824829101562], "pos": [-1004.9591674804688, 1444.371826171875], "id": 47, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["English pop ballad, piano-driven, warm male vocals with soft tone, gentle strings and slow drums. Melancholic but hopeful vibe, theme about heartbreak and moving on. Cinematic build in the chorus, clean and polished production, emotional but not over-the-top. Lyrics must be in pure English, no Chinese language.\n\n节奏轻快的欧美英文流行歌曲，充满夏日活力。年轻女声主唱，音色干净明亮。搭配抓耳的钢琴分解和弦和热带House鼓点，副歌朗朗上口。整体氛围轻松治愈，主题是夏日恋爱与自由。制作现代、混音干净，无杂音，适合电台播放。\n\n\n\n\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 2, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [478.4386291503906, 194.37060546875], "pos": [-501.0003967285156, 1798.43115234375], "id": 53, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\nYeah, yeah\nOh, oh\n\n[Verse 1]\nWoke up this morning with the sun in my eyes\nThe world feels brighter, like I'm finally alive\nNo more dark clouds hanging over my head\nI'm ready to run, ready to forget the past\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nThe beat drops, my heart races\nI'm stepping out of my comfort zone tonight\nNo more hiding, no more fears\nI'm gonna live like there's no tomorrow\n\n[Chorus]\nThis is my moment, my time to shine\nGonna dance like nobody's watching, gonna lose my mind\nThis is my story, my song to sing\nI'm taking back the power, letting my heart lead\nYeah, this is my moment, my time to shine\nNo more waiting, no more \"maybe next time\"\nI'm gonna rise up, touch the sky\nThis is my moment, and I'm gonna own it tonight\n\n[Verse 2]\nUsed to be scared of what the world might say\nTried to fit in, but I lost my way\nNow I'm breaking free from the chains they put on me\nLearning to love the person I was always meant to be\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nThe beat drops, my heart races\nI'm stepping out of my comfort zone tonight\nNo more hiding, no more fears\nI'm gonna live like there's no tomorrow\n\n[Chorus]\nThis is my moment, my time to shine\nGonna dance like nobody's watching, gonna lose my mind\nThis is my story, my song to sing\nI'm taking back the power, letting my heart lead\nYeah, this is my moment, my time to shine\nNo more waiting, no more \"maybe next time\"\nI'm gonna rise up, touch the sky\nThis is my moment, and I'm gonna own it tonight\n\n[Outro]\nOh, I'm gonna own it tonight\nYeah, this is my moment\nOh, yeah"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [294.0045471191406, 262.08221435546875], "pos": [252.81423950195312, 955.4356079101562], "id": 54, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "OPT_CONNECTION", "type": "*"}], "size": [483.53851318359375, 99.3303451538086], "pos": [-1701.642333984375, 1177.39208984375], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 58, "type": "Fast Groups Muter (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "AUDIO"}], "size": [313.48541259765625, 145.1988525390625], "pos": [92.59561157226562, 1707.1163330078125], "widgets_values": ["2e4cc21d8eb13d26b0febd8f39248d86bd3fcd3c1b3d7007ad00f412078b2355.flac", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "COM